# HP50g stock ARMToolbox install probe.
# Format: <absolute-ms> <tap|chord|capture|fail|monitor|finish-install> [args...]
# The destination picker defaults to HOME. 3:SD is the source volume, so the
# sequence confirms immediately instead of moving DOWN first.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
7000 chord lshift files
9200 capture files
9500 tap up
9800 tap f6
11500 capture sd
12000 tap enter
12800 capture sd-setup
13200 tap f2
14200 capture copy
14500 tap f6
16500 capture copy-result
16600 fail copy-result-probe
